  "writingModel": [
    "My family has five people: my mother, my father, my brother, my sister, and me. We are a warm and close family. I love my family very much, and I miss them every day here in Uralsk.",
    "My mother's name is Ainur. She is 44 years old and she works as a doctor at the city hospital. She is kind, caring, and very hardworking. Her hobby is cooking traditional Kazakh food. Her beshbarmak is the best in the world!",
